{"seq":46,"slug":"tech-strategy-radar","title":"技术战略与技术雷达","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar","rating":{"composite":4.45,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 技术战略与技术雷达\n\n技术战略不是空中楼阁般的愿景陈述，而是在资源约束下把技术能力转化为商业竞争力的决策体系。ThoughtWorks 自 2010 年起持续发布的技术雷达（Technology Radar）将这一决策过程系统化——通过象限分类与环级推荐，把全球一线技术顾问的实战经验压缩为可操作的采纳信号。2026 年 4 月的 Vol.34 首次将\"认知债\"提升为核心议题，标志着技术战略从\"选什么技术\"演变为\"如何管理技术带来的认知复杂度\"。\n\n本 hub 聚焦于**技术决策的方法论与治理机制**。与相邻 hub 的分工边界如下：\n\n- **战略管理**（strategic-management）处理企业层面的竞争定位、增长方向与资源配置——本 hub 关注的是技术维度如何承接和落地这些战略意图\n- **工程管理**（engineering-management）聚焦团队运营、人员发展与日常交付效率——本 hub 覆盖的是跨越团队边界的技术投资组合决策\n- **变革管理**（change-management）提供组织变革的通用方法论——本 hub 中的迁移规划和技术债清偿借用其中的变革推进技术，但聚焦于技术资产的生命周期\n\n推荐学习路径：先从「基础」章节建立技术战略的思维框架和决策模型，再进入「雷达方法论」理解评估工具的运作机制，然后通过「创新」章节掌握面向未来的技术探索方法，最终在「执行」章节学习将战略意图转化为可交付路线图的实操技巧。\n\n前置知识：具备基本的软件工程实践经验（3 年以上），了解敏捷开发流程与持续交付概念，对企业技术栈的组成有直觉认知。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础框架","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tech-strategy-frameworks","title":"技术战略框架","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/foundations/tech-strategy-frameworks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"build-buy-partner-decisions","title":"自建、外购与合作决策","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/foundations/build-buy-partner-decisions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"technology-lifecycle-management","title":"技术生命周期管理","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/foundations/technology-lifecycle-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"radar-methodology","title":"雷达方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/radar-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"radar-quadrants-rings","title":"象限与环的设计","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/radar-methodology/radar-quadrants-rings"},{"seq":2,"slug":"assessment-scoring-process","title":"评估与打分流程","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/radar-methodology/assessment-scoring-process"},{"seq":3,"slug":"radar-governance-cadence","title":"雷达治理与节奏","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/radar-methodology/radar-governance-cadence"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"innovation","title":"创新管理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/innovation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"innovation-time-allocation","title":"创新时间分配","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/innovation/innovation-time-allocation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"proof-of-concept-spikes","title":"概念验证与技术探针","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/innovation/proof-of-concept-spikes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"emerging-tech-evaluation","title":"新兴技术评估","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/innovation/emerging-tech-evaluation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"execution","title":"执行落地","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/execution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"migration-roadmap-planning","title":"迁移路线图规划","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/execution/migration-roadmap-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tech-debt-strategic-paydown","title":"技术债务战略清偿","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/execution/tech-debt-strategic-paydown"},{"seq":3,"slug":"measuring-tech-investment","title":"技术投资度量","url":"/h/management/tech-strategy-radar/execution/measuring-tech-investment"}]}]}